### 1. GET all books (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books

### 2. GET one book, existing (200)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 3. GET one book, not found (404 after Task 3)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/books/999

### 4. POST create a book (201 + Location)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "New Book",
  "author": "John Doe",
  "year": 2024,
  "price": 29.99
}

### 5. POST with empty title (400 after Task 3)
POST http://localhost:8080/api/books
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "",
  "author": "John Doe",
  "year": 2024,
  "price": 29.99
}

### 6. PUT update a book (200)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/books/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Effective Java 4th Edition",
  "author": "Joshua Bloch",
  "year": 2024,
  "price": 49.99
}

### 7. DELETE a book (204)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1

### 8. DELETE the same book again (404 after Task 3)
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/books/1